Aerobus CNC Machine Air Compressor
Product DescriptionEngineered for small tooling applications, the powerful Aerobus CNC machine air compressor can deliver high volumes of compressed air at higher pressure — exceeding 70 psi. With a 5500 CFM continuous output at 60 psi — enough power to operate a variety of air-powered tools — the Aerobus compressor is easy to operate and maintain. It's built for performance, reliability, and simplicity.The Aerobus CNC machine air compressor features a single-stage compressor design that drives a centrifugal air motor. A self-contained oil cooler helps maintain clean, dry air with no maintenance hassle, and the innovative quick-change pump design allows easy tool changes throughout your project. The compressor includes a robust and durable air regulator valve that features low leakage, superior accuracy and long life.Product SpecificationsPart Number:SS2L5Start up kit includedTechnical DetailsDurable cast iron cylinders, heads, and frame are designed for continuous operation and extended pump lifeOversized belt wheel provides reliable design and cooler operationIngersoll Rand synthetic lubricant provides 2,000-hour oil change intervals(four times longer than mineral-based lubricantsHigh-efficiency stainless steel finger valves are simple, efficient, and easy to maintainManual thermal overload protection of the motorProduct DescriptionDesigned for the professional, single-stage air compressors are ideal for most anyone, from the do-it-yourselfer to the professional air compressor user. Maximum air power and more delivered air (CFM) providing the power to do the job right and in less time. Durable cast iron construction with precision engineered quality components. Warranty on the pump extends to 2 years with the use of appropriate start-up kit (see below). U.S.A. CFM at 90 PSI: 10.5, Max. PSI: 135, Volts: 230, Amps: 22.5 at full load; 120 at startup; recommend 60 Amp dual pull breaker, HP: 11, Air Tank Size (gal.): 40, Tank Description: Vertical, Pump: Single-stage oil-lubricated, Air Outlet Size (in.): 1/2, Portable or Stationary: Stationary, Dimensions L x W x H (in.): 25 x 30 x 56Product DetailsItem Weight:510 poundsShipping Weight:854 poundsShipping:Currently
